(3797096, 533751, 68035, '<td valign="top">Super applause for this image.  In the challenge a lot of people seem to have gone for simply shooting ''normal'' things that happen to be walking away from them.  You however have really got to grips with the idea of the challenge and whatismore have produced a stunning image to boot.  Lovely B&amp;W conversion, loving the tones and contrast and the border works well One word.  Brilliant.....Oh and heres another word....Ten</td>', 'Super applause for this image.  In the challenge a lot of people seem to have gone for simply shooting ''normal'' things that happen to be walking away from them.  You however have really got to grips with the idea of the challenge and whatismore have produced a stunning image to boot.  Lovely B&W conversion, loving the tones and contrast and the border works well One word.  Brilliant.....Oh and heres another word....Ten', '2007-06-18 09:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3797098, 535360, 68035, '<td valign="top">In one way not sure if it truely meets the challenge as the backside of a cow is not necessarily the ''side less seen'' However forget about that (and anyone who criticises you for it) this is a wonderful appealing image, brilliantly composed and executed</td>', 'In one way not sure if it truely meets the challenge as the backside of a cow is not necessarily the ''side less seen'' However forget about that (and anyone who criticises you for it) this is a wonderful appealing image, brilliantly composed and executed', '2007-06-18 09:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
