(3797995, 537781, 43156, '<td valign="top">Good lighting here, maybe just a bit overblown on the left hand side; and I like the softness of the image. I think overall is a great shot. 8</td>', 'Good lighting here, maybe just a bit overblown on the left hand side; and I like the softness of the image. I think overall is a great shot. 8', '2007-06-18 13:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
