(3798017, 538131, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the just slightly just off-center crop on this.  The lighting may be a bit harsh, but not so much that it is terribly distracting.</td>', 'I like the just slightly just off-center crop on this.  The lighting may be a bit harsh, but not so much that it is terribly distracting.', '2007-06-18 13:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
