(3798034, 537065, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the contrast between the colors in this and the fact that it is "soft" while being focused well.</td>', 'I really like the contrast between the colors in this and the fact that it is "soft" while being focused well.', '2007-06-18 13:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798035, 537744, 811, '<td valign="top">Good focus and I like the background colors</td>', 'Good focus and I like the background colors', '2007-06-18 13:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798059, 535645, 811, '<td valign="top">I really, really like the simplicity in the composition and colors in this.  It is a very nicely executed photograph that is stunning graphically. It looks kinda funky to me down around her legs, though.  Otherwise, a tremendous shot</td>', 'I really, really like the simplicity in the composition and colors in this.  It is a very nicely executed photograph that is stunning graphically. It looks kinda funky to me down around her legs, though.  Otherwise, a tremendous shot', '2007-06-18 13:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798060, 536778, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the bw in this, and I think the crop is good.  It doesn''t really seem significantly like a ''back'' though.</td>', 'I like the bw in this, and I think the crop is good.  It doesn''t really seem significantly like a ''back'' though.', '2007-06-18 13:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798062, 538096, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition and I like the subtle colors.  Works well with the silhouette.</td>', 'Good composition and I like the subtle colors.  Works well with the silhouette.', '2007-06-18 13:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798065, 537783, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors</td>', 'Nice composition and colors', '2007-06-18 13:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798068, 537036, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the dof you have chosen to utilize in this shot.</td>', 'I like the dof you have chosen to utilize in this shot.', '2007-06-18 14:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798070, 537766, 811, '<td valign="top">Very lovely - soft and feminine.</td>', 'Very lovely - soft and feminine.', '2007-06-18 14:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798098, 538212, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the rich colors and composition in this.  It is the backside, but it may not be obvious at first glance, especially to someone not used to barns.</td>', 'I really like the rich colors and composition in this.  It is the backside, but it may not be obvious at first glance, especially to someone not used to barns.', '2007-06-18 14:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798101, 537862, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition and the lighting is great in this</td>', 'Great composition and the lighting is great in this', '2007-06-18 14:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798102, 537605, 811, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors</td>', 'Lovely colors', '2007-06-18 14:08:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798112, 537874, 811, '<td valign="top">Good exposure to be able to see the details both up close and in the distance.  Also, I think bw works well here</td>', 'Good exposure to be able to see the details both up close and in the distance.  Also, I think bw works well here', '2007-06-18 14:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798114, 533231, 811, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like he is skating on top of the fence.  I think a vertical crop, or any crop where he wasn''t centered, would make this a stronger composition</td>', 'It almost looks like he is skating on top of the fence.  I think a vertical crop, or any crop where he wasn''t centered, would make this a stronger composition', '2007-06-18 14:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798115, 538162, 811, '<td valign="top">Good colors.  Kinda stretching with the title, I think. ;)</td>', 'Good colors.  Kinda stretching with the title, I think. ;)', '2007-06-18 14:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798122, 536547, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition and I think the high contrast with the lighting lends itself well to developing the mood of this shot -- dark, mysterious, and just a touch scary.</td>', 'Good composition and I think the high contrast with the lighting lends itself well to developing the mood of this shot -- dark, mysterious, and just a touch scary.', '2007-06-18 14:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798123, 538091, 811, '<td valign="top">Very elegant and graceful.  The bottom of her foot being cropped out is mildly detracting, though.</td>', 'Very elegant and graceful.  The bottom of her foot being cropped out is mildly detracting, though.', '2007-06-18 14:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798126, 537132, 811, '<td valign="top">If the focus was sharper, or the lighting better, on the object in the front, I think this would be a stronger image.</td>', 'If the focus was sharper, or the lighting better, on the object in the front, I think this would be a stronger image.', '2007-06-18 14:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798128, 537790, 811, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome shot -- it is technically well done, and tells a story as well.  Probably a bit of a reach for the challenge, but I can see where you are coming from.</td>', 'This is an awesome shot -- it is technically well done, and tells a story as well.  Probably a bit of a reach for the challenge, but I can see where you are coming from.', '2007-06-18 14:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798134, 537146, 811, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop on the left and top would have made this a stronger composition, I think.  As it is, the white building actually competes for the eyes'' attention because it is lighter than the surrounding background and grabs the attention from the rest of the shot.</td>', 'A tighter crop on the left and top would have made this a stronger composition, I think.  As it is, the white building actually competes for the eyes'' attention because it is lighter than the surrounding background and grabs the attention from the rest of the shot.', '2007-06-18 14:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798137, 535358, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I like the lighting on this</td>', 'Nice portrait. I like the lighting on this', '2007-06-18 14:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798139, 537723, 811, '<td valign="top">A different background, or one that wouldn''t blend quite so with the fur would have made this a bit better, I think.  As it is, everything kinda blends together in a neutral gray.  Also, the crop feels awkward.</td>', 'A different background, or one that wouldn''t blend quite so with the fur would have made this a bit better, I think.  As it is, everything kinda blends together in a neutral gray.  Also, the crop feels awkward.', '2007-06-18 14:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798141, 537970, 811, '<td valign="top">Great lighting on the tail and capture.</td>', 'Great lighting on the tail and capture.', '2007-06-18 14:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798142, 538116, 811, '<td valign="top">Subtle and done well.</td>', 'Subtle and done well.', '2007-06-18 14:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798145, 536698, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the color contrast in this, and how the colors form three "strat" of green, yellow, and blue.  Also, having this rotated like this really makes for a strong composition because it gives the shot some diagonal "movement" rather than just a straight horizontal/vertical look.</td>', 'I like the color contrast in this, and how the colors form three "strat" of green, yellow, and blue.  Also, having this rotated like this really makes for a strong composition because it gives the shot some diagonal "movement" rather than just a straight horizontal/vertical look.', '2007-06-18 14:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798147, 538079, 811, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of negative space.  I like the subtle blue tones of the shot.</td>', 'Good composition and use of negative space.  I like the subtle blue tones of the shot.', '2007-06-18 14:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798149, 536947, 72317, '<td valign="top">Awwwh.. I was going to do the exact same thing.. Only my rabbit was black and she was going to be on the grass..<br/>But she died.<br/>o.o<br/> <br/>Anywho..<br/>I personally would like it better if the head was in focus too, but it fits the challenge better the way that it is. So I guess I can''t say much. I''m not voting, just commenting select photographs. I think this is very nice.</td>', 'Awwwh.. I was going to do the exact same thing.. Only my rabbit was black and she was going to be on the grass..But she died.o.o Anywho..I personally would like it better if the head was in focus too, but it fits the challenge better the way that it is. So I guess I can''t say much. I''m not voting, just commenting select photographs. I think this is very nice.', '2007-06-18 14:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798150, 537424, 811, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but the trees being on one side and not the other is a bit unbalanced feeling. Maybe if you could have gotten one with a plain sky, or with something really interesting in the background, it would be a stronger shot.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but the trees being on one side and not the other is a bit unbalanced feeling. Maybe if you could have gotten one with a plain sky, or with something really interesting in the background, it would be a stronger shot.', '2007-06-18 14:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798153, 538095, 811, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  The motion blur actually adds to it, I think, but the composition doesn''t feel balanced.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  The motion blur actually adds to it, I think, but the composition doesn''t feel balanced.', '2007-06-18 14:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798155, 536767, 811, '<td valign="top">The sepia tone gives this a very nostalgic feeling.</td>', 'The sepia tone gives this a very nostalgic feeling.', '2007-06-18 14:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798157, 538173, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the overall composition on this, but it seems to have a slightly blue cast to it, and there seems to be some halo-ing around the barn, especially on the right.</td>', 'I like the overall composition on this, but it seems to have a slightly blue cast to it, and there seems to be some halo-ing around the barn, especially on the right.', '2007-06-18 14:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798158, 538189, 811, '<td valign="top">Great use of the lighting to emphasize the ''warm'' tones.</td>', 'Great use of the lighting to emphasize the ''warm'' tones.', '2007-06-18 14:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798161, 536920, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the simple colors in this.  I think if you had desaturated the pink flowers, they wouldn''t have been quite so distracting.  As it is, they are so bright and "out of character" with the rest of the colors they scream for attention.</td>', 'I like the simple colors in this.  I think if you had desaturated the pink flowers, they wouldn''t have been quite so distracting.  As it is, they are so bright and "out of character" with the rest of the colors they scream for attention.', '2007-06-18 14:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798206, 537878, 79090, '<td valign="top">really nice. I thought it was a railing in front of a body of water first.</td>', 'really nice. I thought it was a railing in front of a body of water first.', '2007-06-18 14:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3798218, 537719, 79090, '<td valign="top">really trying hard in this (imo) to create something out of a mundane shot.</td>', 'really trying hard in this (imo) to create something out of a mundane shot.', '2007-06-18 14:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
