(3799212, 538086, 811, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the Bugs Bunny cartoons where the dogs take turns being the watcher.</td>', 'Reminds me of the Bugs Bunny cartoons where the dogs take turns being the watcher.', '2007-06-18 19:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799213, 536978, 43774, '<td valign="top">light is a tad harsh but it''s a sweet photo, 8</td>', 'light is a tad harsh but it''s a sweet photo, 8', '2007-06-18 19:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799214, 535422, 9906, '<td valign="top">My first thought was ugghh...  But then I took a (mental) step back and looked again.  Great placement of hand over behind to hid most of the ewww factor.  Nice lighting.  Nice choice of b/w.  Great placement in the frame to give your viewer just enough of your subject.  I would normally say your frame is a bit too impressive but it seems to work here.  You do seem to have some jaggies on the diagonal parts of his leg which is probably from the resize.<br/>TC</td>', 'My first thought was ugghh...  But then I took a (mental) step back and looked again.  Great placement of hand over behind to hid most of the ewww factor.  Nice lighting.  Nice choice of b/w.  Great placement in the frame to give your viewer just enough of your subject.  I would normally say your frame is a bit too impressive but it seems to work here.  You do seem to have some jaggies on the diagonal parts of his leg which is probably from the resize.TC', '2007-06-18 19:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799215, 537954, 43774, '<td valign="top">love the black on red, great lines here, 8</td>', 'love the black on red, great lines here, 8', '2007-06-18 19:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799217, 538131, 43774, '<td valign="top">light might be a bit harsh but it''s a very good composition, 8</td>', 'light might be a bit harsh but it''s a very good composition, 8', '2007-06-18 19:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799219, 537985, 63218, '<td valign="top">nice summer pop art,the black triangular sliver in the lower L corner is not helping this comp</td>', 'nice summer pop art,the black triangular sliver in the lower L corner is not helping this comp', '2007-06-18 19:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799220, 537036, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done if a bit oversaturated.  I think I might have toned the colors back just a touch.  Great seperation of people and environment while giving enough detail of the damn to make sense.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done if a bit oversaturated.  I think I might have toned the colors back just a touch.  Great seperation of people and environment while giving enough detail of the damn to make sense.TC', '2007-06-18 19:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
