(3799251, 536019, 811, '<td valign="top">Took me the longest to figure out your title.  duh.  Very effective, and dramatic, but simple</td>', 'Took me the longest to figure out your title.  duh.  Very effective, and dramatic, but simple', '2007-06-18 19:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799254, 536745, 811, '<td valign="top">I''m not familiar with the familiar side, so I''ll take your word on it. :)  Good contrast between the rock and the tree.  Also, I like the bw in this shot.</td>', 'I''m not familiar with the familiar side, so I''ll take your word on it. :)  Good contrast between the rock and the tree.  Also, I like the bw in this shot.', '2007-06-18 19:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
