(3799257, 537869, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  The whole shot seems a bit flat to me, or something.  Maybe bring down the greens/yellows a touch and boost the overall contrast.  Not sure.</td>', 'Good capture.  The whole shot seems a bit flat to me, or something.  Maybe bring down the greens/yellows a touch and boost the overall contrast.  Not sure.', '2007-06-18 19:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
