(3799277, 536632, 63218, '<td valign="top">surprised. this works nicely. a good title, too.</td>', 'surprised. this works nicely. a good title, too.', '2007-06-18 19:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799281, 538086, 63218, '<td valign="top">well done, nice light &amp; DOF &amp; a story</td>', 'well done, nice light & DOF & a story', '2007-06-18 19:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799293, 538198, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your choice of selective desat for this shot really works well.  Nice focus.  Hard sometimes to get that right with a moving target.  Great DOF.  A touch underexposed but overall a nicely done shot!<br/>TC</td>', 'Your choice of selective desat for this shot really works well.  Nice focus.  Hard sometimes to get that right with a moving target.  Great DOF.  A touch underexposed but overall a nicely done shot!TC', '2007-06-18 19:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799296, 536512, 9906, '<td valign="top">I guess that technically this fits the challenge but not what I would have expected to see.  Not sure I like the selective desat.<br/>TC</td>', 'I guess that technically this fits the challenge but not what I would have expected to see.  Not sure I like the selective desat.TC', '2007-06-18 19:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799298, 538123, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the shadow being where it was...  Nice vivid colors without being overdone.<br/>TC</td>', 'Too bad about the shadow being where it was...  Nice vivid colors without being overdone.TC', '2007-06-18 19:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799300, 538129, 9906, '<td valign="top">Like the simple muted tones.  You look to be a touch oversharpened.  See the white line on both sides of the pole?  This however could be because it''s such a dark subject against a much brighter background.  Tough to get the sharpening right here.<br/>TC</td>', 'Like the simple muted tones.  You look to be a touch oversharpened.  See the white line on both sides of the pole?  This however could be because it''s such a dark subject against a much brighter background.  Tough to get the sharpening right here.TC', '2007-06-18 20:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799305, 538247, 9906, '<td valign="top">Cropped a little tight on the right.  The writing on the wall looks funny.  It''s probably because it''s too much detail to be at 640 x whatever and probably looks good at normal size.<br/>TC</td>', 'Cropped a little tight on the right.  The writing on the wall looks funny.  It''s probably because it''s too much detail to be at 640 x whatever and probably looks good at normal size.TC', '2007-06-18 20:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799308, 537551, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great tonality!  Nice angle and perfectly sharp.  However it''s not got a lotta ooomph to it...<br/>TC</td>', 'Great tonality!  Nice angle and perfectly sharp.  However it''s not got a lotta ooomph to it...TC', '2007-06-18 20:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799309, 536960, 9906, '<td valign="top">Soft focus works good here.  Nice tonality.  To bad the back wall wasn''t lit up with the great evening sun too.<br/>TC</td>', 'Soft focus works good here.  Nice tonality.  To bad the back wall wasn''t lit up with the great evening sun too.TC', '2007-06-18 20:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799311, 537558, 9906, '<td valign="top">Would love to see this.  Wonder where it is...<br/>TC</td>', 'Would love to see this.  Wonder where it is...TC', '2007-06-18 20:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799312, 536501, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not sure I care for the processing or the uneven border.<br/>TC</td>', 'Not sure I care for the processing or the uneven border.TC', '2007-06-18 20:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799315, 537578, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I think it would have looked better if there was a little more negative space around the frame and if the frame where <i>either</i> more square in the shot or more tilted.  The way it is here looks awkward.<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I think it would have looked better if there was a little more negative space around the frame and if the frame where either more square in the shot or more tilted.  The way it is here looks awkward.TC', '2007-06-18 20:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799316, 537632, 9906, '<td valign="top">I know it''s not what it looks like but ''eeewwww''.<br/>TC</td>', 'I know it''s not what it looks like but ''eeewwww''.TC', '2007-06-18 20:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799318, 538245, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great title!  I''m not keen on animal butt shots though...<br/>TC</td>', 'Great title!  I''m not keen on animal butt shots though...TC', '2007-06-18 20:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799319, 538263, 9906, '<td valign="top">This to me says side and not back.  I think that you could have used a little more fill light on her actual backside.<br/>TC</td>', 'This to me says side and not back.  I think that you could have used a little more fill light on her actual backside.TC', '2007-06-18 20:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3799324, 536978, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  Love the choice of b/w for this but think that you could have come up with a better shade of grey for the sky.  Also you''ve lost a lot of the detail in his shorts.  Love the fact that you got down low to shoot it.  All in all one of the better kid shots I''ve seen recently.  Kudos.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a great shot!  Love the choice of b/w for this but think that you could have come up with a better shade of grey for the sky.  Also you''ve lost a lot of the detail in his shorts.  Love the fact that you got down low to shoot it.  All in all one of the better kid shots I''ve seen recently.  Kudos.TC', '2007-06-18 20:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
