(3799362, 537782, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting take.  I''m a little confused by the selective desat though.  It doesn''t add anything to the shot, at least to my eye.  It especially looks odd where her fingers come through the palette.  I think your focus is off too.  It doesn''t come across as soft focus because the easel leg between the palette and the painting looks sharp but nothing else does.  Great idea.  If you can reshoot it I would love to see it...<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting take.  I''m a little confused by the selective desat though.  It doesn''t add anything to the shot, at least to my eye.  It especially looks odd where her fingers come through the palette.  I think your focus is off too.  It doesn''t come across as soft focus because the easel leg between the palette and the painting looks sharp but nothing else does.  Great idea.  If you can reshoot it I would love to see it...TC', '2007-06-18 20:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
