(3802403, 537532, 811, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  I like the feathers in the front, sort of "framing" him.  A tighter crop to eliminate the hands on the right might have proven less distracting though</td>', 'Good capture.  I like the feathers in the front, sort of "framing" him.  A tighter crop to eliminate the hands on the right might have proven less distracting though', '2007-06-19 16:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
