(3802426, 537822, 811, '<td valign="top">Focus seems just a touch off.  If that were my kids, they would be spitting on eachother, and not in the sink, by the time they were finished. :)</td>', 'Focus seems just a touch off.  If that were my kids, they would be spitting on eachother, and not in the sink, by the time they were finished. :)', '2007-06-19 16:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
