(3802430, 536335, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the stern, but the coloring seems a bit odd to me.  I don''t think it is particularly effective in this, though if it were "turned down" just a touch, it might be.</td>', 'I like the stern, but the coloring seems a bit odd to me.  I don''t think it is particularly effective in this, though if it were "turned down" just a touch, it might be.', '2007-06-19 16:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
