(3802955, 537196, 66353, '<td valign="top">I don''t even want to think about what "Rome" meens here :)<br/>I think I would have liked the crop a little tighter (top and right) to make the diagonal composition more obvious.</td>', 'I don''t even want to think about what "Rome" meens here :)I think I would have liked the crop a little tighter (top and right) to make the diagonal composition more obvious.', '2007-06-19 18:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802956, 537982, 58728, '<td valign="top">Looks like a little too much processing...seemed to lose a little of the photograph quality...looks more like a drawing now.  I do like the subject though.</td>', 'Looks like a little too much processing...seemed to lose a little of the photograph quality...looks more like a drawing now.  I do like the subject though.', '2007-06-19 18:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802957, 537955, 58728, '<td valign="top">HAHA.  I remember that part in the movie.  Too cute!</td>', 'HAHA.  I remember that part in the movie.  Too cute!', '2007-06-19 18:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802958, 537642, 58728, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I think the left side could be cropped even a tad bit more..it''s a little distracting.  But I do like the feeling that we are peeking around the corner to see this.</td>', 'Nice.  I think the left side could be cropped even a tad bit more..it''s a little distracting.  But I do like the feeling that we are peeking around the corner to see this.', '2007-06-19 18:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802959, 537726, 66353, '<td valign="top">Would have liked a little more detail on the feathers (yes, I know it''s hard on a black bird).</td>', 'Would have liked a little more detail on the feathers (yes, I know it''s hard on a black bird).', '2007-06-19 18:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802960, 536788, 58728, '<td valign="top">Very interesting perspective.  I like how the model''s face was kept a bit dark, since we are focusing on her backside.  nice.</td>', 'Very interesting perspective.  I like how the model''s face was kept a bit dark, since we are focusing on her backside.  nice.', '2007-06-19 18:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802964, 536594, 66353, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked it better if you had shown the subjects in full figure. It looks a little amputated like this.</td>', 'I think I would have liked it better if you had shown the subjects in full figure. It looks a little amputated like this.', '2007-06-19 18:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802967, 536330, 66353, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and colors but not a terribly interesting shot. I think a tighter crop in the top could improve it a little though.</td>', 'Good lighting and colors but not a terribly interesting shot. I think a tighter crop in the top could improve it a little though.', '2007-06-19 18:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802973, 538279, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cute but the crop is a little awkward feeling...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cute but the crop is a little awkward feeling...TC', '2007-06-19 18:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802978, 536868, 66353, '<td valign="top">Good light and colors. A little more movement would have been nice though.</td>', 'Good light and colors. A little more movement would have been nice though.', '2007-06-19 18:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802979, 538093, 9906, '<td valign="top">It''s a little dark and a little busy and I''m not sure I get what you are trying to say with it.<br/>TC</td>', 'It''s a little dark and a little busy and I''m not sure I get what you are trying to say with it.TC', '2007-06-19 18:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802981, 536588, 58728, '<td valign="top">Cute idea..the backbone of the skeleton.  The lighting is a bit harsh though.</td>', 'Cute idea..the backbone of the skeleton.  The lighting is a bit harsh though.', '2007-06-19 18:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802983, 538045, 9906, '<td valign="top">I guess I don''t get what you are trying to do here.  Technically it''s quite busy and a bit soft.<br/>TC</td>', 'I guess I don''t get what you are trying to do here.  Technically it''s quite busy and a bit soft.TC', '2007-06-19 18:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802984, 537789, 66353, '<td valign="top">Mean looking car and nice perspective. I think I would have cloned away the car on the left edge. (or cropped a little closer)</td>', 'Mean looking car and nice perspective. I think I would have cloned away the car on the left edge. (or cropped a little closer)', '2007-06-19 18:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802986, 537059, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m confused as to why you would focus on the little leafs and not the flower.  Your colors are quite flat.  I wonder what you could do with levels and curves to make it pop more...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m confused as to why you would focus on the little leafs and not the flower.  Your colors are quite flat.  I wonder what you could do with levels and curves to make it pop more...TC', '2007-06-19 18:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802987, 537822, 58728, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  I feel like a different crop may have helped this.  Maybe if you could see more of their faces peeking from the mirror...  or a bit brighter light might have helped as well.</td>', 'Cute idea.  I feel like a different crop may have helped this.  Maybe if you could see more of their faces peeking from the mirror...  or a bit brighter light might have helped as well.', '2007-06-19 18:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802990, 537330, 9906, '<td valign="top">Fit''s the challenge but kinda boring.  Did you add the vignette?  The shot is so dark in tonality that I don''t think vignetting adds anything.<br/>TC</td>', 'Fit''s the challenge but kinda boring.  Did you add the vignette?  The shot is so dark in tonality that I don''t think vignetting adds anything.TC', '2007-06-19 18:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802993, 537829, 58728, '<td valign="top">I like the dreamy quality of the processing, but I do not feel that it adds anything to the image.</td>', 'I like the dreamy quality of the processing, but I do not feel that it adds anything to the image.', '2007-06-19 18:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802996, 538100, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Good crisp image.  Nice colors without being over the top.  Excitement level is a little low though.  Damn there''s a lot of flowers in this challenge!  :-P<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely done.  Good crisp image.  Nice colors without being over the top.  Excitement level is a little low though.  Damn there''s a lot of flowers in this challenge!  :-PTC', '2007-06-19 18:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802997, 537620, 9906, '<td valign="top">Way oversharpened (see the wite lines around your dark lines?) and the processing isn''t to my taste.<br/>TC</td>', 'Way oversharpened (see the wite lines around your dark lines?) and the processing isn''t to my taste.TC', '2007-06-19 18:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3802999, 537138, 9906, '<td valign="top">A little blown out but very cute shot!  Good choice going with the sepia style tonality.<br/>TC</td>', 'A little blown out but very cute shot!  Good choice going with the sepia style tonality.TC', '2007-06-19 18:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803001, 537640, 58728, '<td valign="top">HAHa.  He''s cute!  That eye is so interesting!  I think it may have done just as well without the border though.  It''s a bit distracting to me.</td>', 'HAHa.  He''s cute!  That eye is so interesting!  I think it may have done just as well without the border though.  It''s a bit distracting to me.', '2007-06-19 18:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803002, 537580, 14620, '<td valign="top">My most absolute favorite of this challenge.  The BW conversion is perfect.  I really love all the rain and how it really stands out and also how they are perfectly insync with each other from their coats to their movements.  And what to say about that funky umbrella... It''s all just so lovely.<br/> <br/>Bumping up... 10!</td>', 'My most absolute favorite of this challenge.  The BW conversion is perfect.  I really love all the rain and how it really stands out and also how they are perfectly insync with each other from their coats to their movements.  And what to say about that funky umbrella... It''s all just so lovely. Bumping up... 10!', '2007-06-19 18:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803004, 536109, 9906, '<td valign="top">I was about to say that it''s too centered but with all the shots so far with the  flower jammed down in the corner, it''s kinda refreshing.<br/>TC</td>', 'I was about to say that it''s too centered but with all the shots so far with the  flower jammed down in the corner, it''s kinda refreshing.TC', '2007-06-19 18:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803005, 537638, 58728, '<td valign="top">Lovely idea.  I think the crop should maybe not have been as tight though.  I feel like it takes a bit away from the image.</td>', 'Lovely idea.  I think the crop should maybe not have been as tight though.  I feel like it takes a bit away from the image.', '2007-06-19 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803007, 537559, 9906, '<td valign="top">Technically sound but of very little interest...<br/>TC</td>', 'Technically sound but of very little interest...TC', '2007-06-19 18:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803012, 536288, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF but animal butts are not up my alley...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice DOF but animal butts are not up my alley...TC', '2007-06-19 18:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803016, 537328, 58728, '<td valign="top">Image looks a little oof to me...not in a huge way.  It may even be my monitor.  But I feel like it may benefit from a bit of sharpening.</td>', 'Image looks a little oof to me...not in a huge way.  It may even be my monitor.  But I feel like it may benefit from a bit of sharpening.', '2007-06-19 18:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803017, 537766, 9906, '<td valign="top">Hmmm...  I like this but I''m not sure it fits into the <i>spirit</i> of the challenge theme.  The background is a bit distracting...<br/>TC</td>', 'Hmmm...  I like this but I''m not sure it fits into the spirit of the challenge theme.  The background is a bit distracting...TC', '2007-06-19 18:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803019, 537712, 58728, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Not often do we look at the backsides of our art pieces.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Not often do we look at the backsides of our art pieces.', '2007-06-19 18:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803021, 536289, 9906, '<td valign="top">Now this is a great shot.  I love the depth that you have.  I love the subdued lighting on the girls.  I can smell the smells of the woods and hear the birds chirping.  Very cute and touching all at the same time.  Kudos.<br/>TC</td>', 'Now this is a great shot.  I love the depth that you have.  I love the subdued lighting on the girls.  I can smell the smells of the woods and hear the birds chirping.  Very cute and touching all at the same time.  Kudos.TC', '2007-06-19 18:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803027, 538141, 66353, '<td valign="top">A different take on the challenge. I believe it would have worked better with a T-shot I think (or whatever you would call it - I''m not a golfer) - or maybe a put...  I just want to get the ball and club out of the grass...</td>', 'A different take on the challenge. I believe it would have worked better with a T-shot I think (or whatever you would call it - I''m not a golfer) - or maybe a put...  I just want to get the ball and club out of the grass...', '2007-06-19 18:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803028, 538286, 58728, '<td valign="top">Love the perspective here.  It leads your eye.</td>', 'Love the perspective here.  It leads your eye.', '2007-06-19 18:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803032, 537912, 66353, '<td valign="top">A a wiever I find it quite annoying that I can''t see what the finger is pointing at - or at least see the whole finger (if it''s there)</td>', 'A a wiever I find it quite annoying that I can''t see what the finger is pointing at - or at least see the whole finger (if it''s there)', '2007-06-19 18:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803038, 536089, 66353, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and good light. I think I would have cropped it at the edge of the yellow wall on the right. Would have made a stronger composition IMO.</td>', 'Nice colors and good light. I think I would have cropped it at the edge of the yellow wall on the right. Would have made a stronger composition IMO.', '2007-06-19 18:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803044, 537430, 66353, '<td valign="top">On the edge indeed :)<br/>Nice detail and light but a little over-saturated I think (unless you have ladybirds in a different color than where I live)</td>', 'On the edge indeed :)Nice detail and light but a little over-saturated I think (unless you have ladybirds in a different color than where I live)', '2007-06-19 18:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803050, 537802, 66353, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and shot at the perfect time of day to get good shadows.</td>', 'Nice composition and shot at the perfect time of day to get good shadows.', '2007-06-19 18:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803054, 538212, 66353, '<td valign="top">Nice postprocessing - especially on the sky.</td>', 'Nice postprocessing - especially on the sky.', '2007-06-19 18:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803059, 538038, 66353, '<td valign="top">A true handyman :)  Quite original and well executed.</td>', 'A true handyman :)  Quite original and well executed.', '2007-06-19 18:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803063, 537065, 66353, '<td valign="top">Nice soft colors but your hightlights seem to burn out a little.</td>', 'Nice soft colors but your hightlights seem to burn out a little.', '2007-06-19 18:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803067, 535360, 66353, '<td valign="top">Mean looking creature - and an original take on the challenge. Good luck :)</td>', 'Mean looking creature - and an original take on the challenge. Good luck :)', '2007-06-19 18:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803076, 537147, 66353, '<td valign="top">Looks a little dark - no details left in the blouse. I think I would have preffered to see more of her legs and less of her torso - just to get what I guess is supposed to be the "main attraction" less centered in the picture.</td>', 'Looks a little dark - no details left in the blouse. I think I would have preffered to see more of her legs and less of her torso - just to get what I guess is supposed to be the "main attraction" less centered in the picture.', '2007-06-19 18:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803080, 538250, 66353, '<td valign="top">Nice diagonal composition and good post processing.</td>', 'Nice diagonal composition and good post processing.', '2007-06-19 18:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803086, 536778, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines nice tonality but not too interesting.  Next time try shooting from a lower angle.  You might get better results.<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting lines nice tonality but not too interesting.  Next time try shooting from a lower angle.  You might get better results.TC', '2007-06-19 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803088, 538286, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''ve been trying not to be a DNMC type of guy but I think you squeezed this one in...  Why did you focus so much on the foreground?  The background looks much more interesting but is kinda soft...<br/>TC</td>', 'I''ve been trying not to be a DNMC type of guy but I think you squeezed this one in...  Why did you focus so much on the foreground?  The background looks much more interesting but is kinda soft...TC', '2007-06-19 18:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803091, 537885, 9906, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if you would have isolated the bus with the crop or even better the camera angle.  I think that the background here is quite cluttered and detracts from the shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'I think this would have been better if you would have isolated the bus with the crop or even better the camera angle.  I think that the background here is quite cluttered and detracts from the shot.TC', '2007-06-19 18:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803092, 537759, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I don''t care for the processing...  You look a little crooked but that just may be the scene...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice shot but I don''t care for the processing...  You look a little crooked but that just may be the scene...TC', '2007-06-19 18:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803093, 537783, 9906, '<td valign="top">A little fill flash would have done wonders for this shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'A little fill flash would have done wonders for this shot.TC', '2007-06-19 18:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803095, 537763, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL...  The back of a backlit sunflower!  Lighting is a little harsh.  Might have helped if you could have had someone twist the stem a little so the light fell more across the flower instead of hitting it dead on.<br/>TC</td>', 'LOL...  The back of a backlit sunflower!  Lighting is a little harsh.  Might have helped if you could have had someone twist the stem a little so the light fell more across the flower instead of hitting it dead on.TC', '2007-06-19 18:40:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3803097, 538162, 9906, '<td valign="top">This looks more like the side to me.  Too bad you had such a bald headed sky to work with.<br/>TC</td>', 'This looks more like the side to me.  Too bad you had such a bald headed sky to work with.TC', '2007-06-19 18:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803099, 538124, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your focus seems to be just at touch off since both flowers seem to be a touch soft.  You also seem to be a touch underexposed as you have no true whites in the frame.<br/>TC</td>', 'Your focus seems to be just at touch off since both flowers seem to be a touch soft.  You also seem to be a touch underexposed as you have no true whites in the frame.TC', '2007-06-19 18:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803103, 537328, 9906, '<td valign="top">Seems a little underexposed.  If you compare the frame with whats in it, you don''t have any real whites in the shot itself.<br/>TC</td>', 'Seems a little underexposed.  If you compare the frame with whats in it, you don''t have any real whites in the shot itself.TC', '2007-06-19 18:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803109, 533751, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually go for this kind of processing but it seems to work very well here.  Don''t care for the lopsided framing though.  Nice job.<br/>TC<br/>PS:  I don''t think the underside is the same as the backside...  ;-)</td>', 'I don''t usually go for this kind of processing but it seems to work very well here.  Don''t care for the lopsided framing though.  Nice job.TCPS:  I don''t think the underside is the same as the backside...  ;-)', '2007-06-19 18:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803116, 536980, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow what a tough exposure.  Your white is a little blow out (back of her hat) while the background is a bit too dark.  Also I think that you''re a touch oversaturated.  The Amish wear clothes that tend to be subdued in colors and this makes her dress look too bright.<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow what a tough exposure.  Your white is a little blow out (back of her hat) while the background is a bit too dark.  Also I think that you''re a touch oversaturated.  The Amish wear clothes that tend to be subdued in colors and this makes her dress look too bright.TC', '2007-06-19 18:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803119, 537587, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice scene.  Where is this?<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice scene.  Where is this?TC', '2007-06-19 18:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803126, 537333, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done if a touch dark.  I keep trying to see more detail in the parents shoulder.  I think it would feel like it fits the challenge better if you weren''t zoomed in so close.  The first thing I saw wasn''t a backside but a face.  Another thing you might try for presentation is using a one pixel black inline then the white inline then the black border.  It gives a bit more seperation between picture and frame.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done if a touch dark.  I keep trying to see more detail in the parents shoulder.  I think it would feel like it fits the challenge better if you weren''t zoomed in so close.  The first thing I saw wasn''t a backside but a face.  Another thing you might try for presentation is using a one pixel black inline then the white inline then the black border.  It gives a bit more seperation between picture and frame.TC', '2007-06-19 18:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803127, 537789, 9906, '<td valign="top">The car to the left of the frame is a bit of a distraction as is the fact that it''s a bit underexposed.  I would love to see more of the detail.<br/>TC</td>', 'The car to the left of the frame is a bit of a distraction as is the fact that it''s a bit underexposed.  I would love to see more of the detail.TC', '2007-06-19 18:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803130, 537584, 9906, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a painting.<br/>TC</td>', 'Almost looks like a painting.TC', '2007-06-19 18:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803132, 533993, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, this looks harsh.  Like it''s too closely cropped and very oversharpened...<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, this looks harsh.  Like it''s too closely cropped and very oversharpened...TC', '2007-06-19 18:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803135, 537982, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out where your focal point is.  I''m not so sure that your oof as much as suffering from camera blur.  Did you shoot this handheld?<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out where your focal point is.  I''m not so sure that your oof as much as suffering from camera blur.  Did you shoot this handheld?TC', '2007-06-19 18:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803138, 536975, 9906, '<td valign="top">Of all the animal butts I''ve seen this is by far the most interesting one.<br/>TC</td>', 'Of all the animal butts I''ve seen this is by far the most interesting one.TC', '2007-06-19 18:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803142, 537580, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Love the grainy feel to it.  Could be on a greeting card.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Love the grainy feel to it.  Could be on a greeting card.TC', '2007-06-19 18:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803144, 537771, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t see backside here at all...<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t see backside here at all...TC', '2007-06-19 18:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803147, 537872, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and composition.  Colors look good on the foreground but I think I would have tried to get more blue out of whater and sky.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice framing and composition.  Colors look good on the foreground but I think I would have tried to get more blue out of whater and sky.TC', '2007-06-19 18:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803150, 535974, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Nice job of stoping as much of the action as you did.  Still a little motion blur but it actually feels right.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great shot!  Nice job of stoping as much of the action as you did.  Still a little motion blur but it actually feels right.TC', '2007-06-19 18:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803154, 537467, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m not big into abstract type shots but this one is kinda cool!<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m not big into abstract type shots but this one is kinda cool!TC', '2007-06-19 18:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803155, 537723, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot simply doesn''t do anything for me...<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot simply doesn''t do anything for me...TC', '2007-06-19 18:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803158, 537264, 9906, '<td valign="top">Don''t fall over backwards!  :-P<br/>TC</td>', 'Don''t fall over backwards!  :-PTC', '2007-06-19 18:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803160, 537269, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the processing in this instance.  Maybe if there was more detail that you could see but with everyone being almost silhouette...<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t care for the processing in this instance.  Maybe if there was more detail that you could see but with everyone being almost silhouette...TC', '2007-06-19 18:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803165, 537175, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely sharp and perfectly saturated.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely sharp and perfectly saturated.TC', '2007-06-19 18:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803174, 538192, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is one instance where the selective desat actually works nice but your background (b/w) is quite flat.  If there was wallpaper or something so you could get more contrasts I think it would have improved the overall oomph of the shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is one instance where the selective desat actually works nice but your background (b/w) is quite flat.  If there was wallpaper or something so you could get more contrasts I think it would have improved the overall oomph of the shot.TC', '2007-06-19 18:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803178, 536291, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Love the overall feel of this but your a touch underexposed.  There are no true whites in the frame.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great shot.  Love the overall feel of this but your a touch underexposed.  There are no true whites in the frame.TC', '2007-06-19 18:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
