(3803231, 538206, 50127, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!!  The tones in this are so beautiful!  The feathers bring your eye into towards the bird and then up to form that very pleasing leaf-like shape.  The symmetry of the bird coupled with the off-center subject make the crop really dynamic.  I love it!  If there would be anything to change at all, I would have liked the crop on the bottom to be closer to his feet, there is just a little too much dead space on the bottom compared to everything else.  But that''s very minor.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately I can''t vote, but if I could 10! 10! 10! 10!!<br/>After seeing everything else... this should get the blue imo.</td>', 'Awesome!!!  The tones in this are so beautiful!  The feathers bring your eye into towards the bird and then up to form that very pleasing leaf-like shape.  The symmetry of the bird coupled with the off-center subject make the crop really dynamic.  I love it!  If there would be anything to change at all, I would have liked the crop on the bottom to be closer to his feet, there is just a little too much dead space on the bottom compared to everything else.  But that''s very minor. Unfortunately I can''t vote, but if I could 10! 10! 10! 10!!After seeing everything else... this should get the blue imo.', '2007-06-19 19:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3803241, 537593, 50127, '<td valign="top">Very awesome photo, but the backside of the spectators isn''t really the focus of the photo... and I think you know that based on the unimaginative title you chose.<br/> <br/>The lighting and color are great.  I can imagine low light made this difficult to catch, but you got some great detail here.  The shark (is it a whale shark?) looks like he is glowing, very cool effect.</td>', 'Very awesome photo, but the backside of the spectators isn''t really the focus of the photo... and I think you know that based on the unimaginative title you chose. The lighting and color are great.  I can imagine low light made this difficult to catch, but you got some great detail here.  The shark (is it a whale shark?) looks like he is glowing, very cool effect.', '2007-06-19 19:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
