(3810214, 537984, 9906, '<td valign="top">LOL...  Great shot!  Little flat on the lighting but other than that funny as hell.<br/>TC</td>', 'LOL...  Great shot!  Little flat on the lighting but other than that funny as hell.TC', '2007-06-20 18:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
