(3810238, 536924, 9906, '<td valign="top">This was taken at a not so photo friendly time of day.  See the harsh shadows?  That''s the first give away.  Did you know this person?  If so you should have attempted to take this later in the evening or earlier in the morning to get the nice golden light.<br/>TC</td>', 'This was taken at a not so photo friendly time of day.  See the harsh shadows?  That''s the first give away.  Did you know this person?  If so you should have attempted to take this later in the evening or earlier in the morning to get the nice golden light.TC', '2007-06-20 18:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3810242, 535421, 9906, '<td valign="top">A better background would help this shot a lot.  The plant in front of the girl is a big distraction.  Something to think about when doing posed shots.<br/>TC</td>', 'A better background would help this shot a lot.  The plant in front of the girl is a big distraction.  Something to think about when doing posed shots.TC', '2007-06-20 18:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
