(3810257, 538161, 9906, '<td valign="top">A cleaner background (less elements like the picture frames to the left and plant to the right) would definatly help out a shot like this.<br/>TC</td>', 'A cleaner background (less elements like the picture frames to the left and plant to the right) would definatly help out a shot like this.TC', '2007-06-20 18:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
