(3815104, 537786, 68256, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot...I love the balance and "humanist" of the instruments.  I guess you saw that too with your title...very well done.</td>', 'wonderful shot...I love the balance and "humanist" of the instruments.  I guess you saw that too with your title...very well done.', '2007-06-21 13:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815114, 538087, 68256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful focus.  It is so hard (well for me anyway) to use the shallow DOF of macros to the benifit of the subject, but you have done so very well.  PS the colors are nice too!</td>', 'Beautiful focus.  It is so hard (well for me anyway) to use the shallow DOF of macros to the benifit of the subject, but you have done so very well.  PS the colors are nice too!', '2007-06-21 13:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815123, 537790, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very well done, I really like everything about this.  Simple, original and technically perfect.  Makes me want some homemade tortillas though :)</td>', 'Very well done, I really like everything about this.  Simple, original and technically perfect.  Makes me want some homemade tortillas though :)', '2007-06-21 13:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815138, 537793, 68256, '<td valign="top">I very much like the natural framing.  I''m not 100% sold on the composition (as far as balance goes) though.  I can''t put my finger on it, but maybe it is the water dividing the composition in 1/2 that seems static?  It is a great photo though and I give it an 8.</td>', 'I very much like the natural framing.  I''m not 100% sold on the composition (as far as balance goes) though.  I can''t put my finger on it, but maybe it is the water dividing the composition in 1/2 that seems static?  It is a great photo though and I give it an 8.', '2007-06-21 13:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815145, 536894, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice Street shot that seems a bit oversaturated.I do really like the POV and leading lines.</td>', 'Nice Street shot that seems a bit oversaturated.I do really like the POV and leading lines.', '2007-06-21 13:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815146, 537578, 74015, '<td valign="top">Really nice and sharp.  Great take on the theme.</td>', 'Really nice and sharp.  Great take on the theme.', '2007-06-21 13:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815158, 536358, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the idea. Focus seems a bit soft and the shadows overwhelm me a bit. Great comp and effective crop.</td>', 'I like the idea. Focus seems a bit soft and the shadows overwhelm me a bit. Great comp and effective crop.', '2007-06-21 13:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815159, 537766, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I had this originally as an 8 when I quickly sorted the other day, but now that I''m back commenting I think I''ll bump it up.  Maybe my original vote was because the skin was too perfect at first glance, but really the processing works for her expression.  I also like the inclusion of her hand (even if it is cut off) because it gives a since of reality to her stance.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I had this originally as an 8 when I quickly sorted the other day, but now that I''m back commenting I think I''ll bump it up.  Maybe my original vote was because the skin was too perfect at first glance, but really the processing works for her expression.  I also like the inclusion of her hand (even if it is cut off) because it gives a since of reality to her stance.', '2007-06-21 13:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815160, 537264, 74015, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred not to have to twist my head around to see it right side up...</td>', 'I would have preferred not to have to twist my head around to see it right side up...', '2007-06-21 13:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815164, 538196, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice candid. I like the comp and the interesting DOF. Title doesn''t work. (for me anyway)</td>', 'Nice candid. I like the comp and the interesting DOF. Title doesn''t work. (for me anyway)', '2007-06-21 13:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815170, 535358, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Left arm seems a bit soft on the focus though.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Left arm seems a bit soft on the focus though.', '2007-06-21 13:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815173, 536633, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp. Great capture and nice contrast.</td>', 'Nice and crisp. Great capture and nice contrast.', '2007-06-21 13:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815174, 538091, 68256, '<td valign="top">Really this is a stunning shot.  I can''t believe I had this as an 8 when I originally voted.  What was I thinking?  Surely I didn''t knock of 2 whole points because a tiny bit of her foot was cut off?  Well anyways now that I''m back to comment and look more critically I can say this is a 10 no doubt.  The perspective is so wonderful.</td>', 'Really this is a stunning shot.  I can''t believe I had this as an 8 when I originally voted.  What was I thinking?  Surely I didn''t knock of 2 whole points because a tiny bit of her foot was cut off?  Well anyways now that I''m back to comment and look more critically I can say this is a 10 no doubt.  The perspective is so wonderful.', '2007-06-21 13:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3815178, 536976, 33672, '<td valign="top">Nic DOF. Great contrast.</td>', 'Nic DOF. Great contrast.', '2007-06-21 13:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
