(3823885, 538200, 76430, '<td valign="top">It took a minute for me to figure out this wasn''t a sticker but the view through the lens of a 35mm camera.  Good capture getting the camera and skull image in focus.</td>', 'It took a minute for me to figure out this wasn''t a sticker but the view through the lens of a 35mm camera.  Good capture getting the camera and skull image in focus.', '2007-06-23 10:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
