(3823914, 537590, 76430, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.  It took me a while to get oriented that you''re on top of the falls shooting down.  I''m not sure about the horizontal 50% split of the frame, maybe an angle would work better, but other than that good shot.</td>', 'Interesting angle.  It took me a while to get oriented that you''re on top of the falls shooting down.  I''m not sure about the horizontal 50% split of the frame, maybe an angle would work better, but other than that good shot.', '2007-06-23 10:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
