(3825019, 537467, 38032, '<td valign="top">This definitely is an image with potential to be on the front page of this web site.  Given the subject and composition, it looks like it should all be pretty well sharp and focused - I think the lack of complete sharpness  and not-extremely-interesting position of the subject hurt this - If it were more obvious that it was at a sharp angle and there was a great deal of depth-of-field, I think the result would be a winner - either that or if the entire thing had a bit more sharpness.  Addtionally, the vignetted background and water drops are beautiful and I think just going for a slightly larger image without a border would have helped also-  This is a tough one to score - let''s go 7 for a great effort with some room for improvement.</td>', 'This definitely is an image with potential to be on the front page of this web site.  Given the subject and composition, it looks like it should all be pretty well sharp and focused - I think the lack of complete sharpness  and not-extremely-interesting position of the subject hurt this - If it were more obvious that it was at a sharp angle and there was a great deal of depth-of-field, I think the result would be a winner - either that or if the entire thing had a bit more sharpness.  Addtionally, the vignetted background and water drops are beautiful and I think just going for a slightly larger image without a border would have helped also-  This is a tough one to score - let''s go 7 for a great effort with some room for improvement.', '2007-06-23 17:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
