(3827658, 538104, 9906, '<td valign="top">OK...  Two animal butts in one shot.  I like what you are trying to do with this actually.  I think it would have worked better if they weren''t lined up so straight.  You know off set a little so the lines don''t run into each other so much.<br/>TC</td>', 'OK...  Two animal butts in one shot.  I like what you are trying to do with this actually.  I think it would have worked better if they weren''t lined up so straight.  You know off set a little so the lines don''t run into each other so much.TC', '2007-06-24 14:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827663, 537955, 9906, '<td valign="top">Funny.  Your colors are too vivid for my taste.  I''m assuming you boosted the saturation.  I think it''s a litte overdone.<br/>TC</td>', 'Funny.  Your colors are too vivid for my taste.  I''m assuming you boosted the saturation.  I think it''s a litte overdone.TC', '2007-06-24 14:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827668, 538013, 9906, '<td valign="top">The tones are beautiful.  The crop on the otherhand looks awkward.  The stuff on the left of the frame is distracting but if you cropped in closer the girl would be too close to the edge of the frame.  I wonder if you could have cloned out the distracting elements.<br/>TC</td>', 'The tones are beautiful.  The crop on the otherhand looks awkward.  The stuff on the left of the frame is distracting but if you cropped in closer the girl would be too close to the edge of the frame.  I wonder if you could have cloned out the distracting elements.TC', '2007-06-24 14:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827673, 537939, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great treatment.  I''m assuming that you chose b/w for this because of the overly contrasty lighting.  I think that you chose properly for this one.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great treatment.  I''m assuming that you chose b/w for this because of the overly contrasty lighting.  I think that you chose properly for this one.TC', '2007-06-24 14:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827674, 538133, 9906, '<td valign="top">This would be a great shot to practice HDR and tone mapping with.  That would help you to bring out more detail in the brick and bring back some of the blown out detail of the outside.  I think that with HDR you could leave this in color effectivly but your b/w treatment works too.<br/>TC</td>', 'This would be a great shot to practice HDR and tone mapping with.  That would help you to bring out more detail in the brick and bring back some of the blown out detail of the outside.  I think that with HDR you could leave this in color effectivly but your b/w treatment works too.TC', '2007-06-24 15:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827675, 536548, 9906, '<td valign="top">That is the bottom of a shoe.  The challenge was Backsides...<br/>TC</td>', 'That is the bottom of a shoe.  The challenge was Backsides...TC', '2007-06-24 15:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827678, 537698, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Looks like a peacefull scene.  I think that the placement of the bench looks a little funny though.  It''s not quite centered and kinda low in the frame...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice.  Looks like a peacefull scene.  I think that the placement of the bench looks a little funny though.  It''s not quite centered and kinda low in the frame...TC', '2007-06-24 15:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827680, 536841, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t wanna be there when those bad boys light up!<br/>TC</td>', 'Wouldn''t wanna be there when those bad boys light up!TC', '2007-06-24 15:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827681, 537531, 9906, '<td valign="top">Fit''s the challenge.  Nicely exposed.  Great how you have a black background and still kept all the detail of the pants and coat and hat.  I have to say that it''s kinda boring though.<br/>TC</td>', 'Fit''s the challenge.  Nicely exposed.  Great how you have a black background and still kept all the detail of the pants and coat and hat.  I have to say that it''s kinda boring though.TC', '2007-06-24 15:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
