(3827684, 538242, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is incredibly well done.  Love the fact that you have just enough detail.  Your lighting is impeccible.  Great how the lines lead your eye from shot top left down to bottom right.  Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'This is incredibly well done.  Love the fact that you have just enough detail.  Your lighting is impeccible.  Great how the lines lead your eye from shot top left down to bottom right.  KudosTC', '2007-06-24 15:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
