(3827688, 537217, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great clouds.<br/>TC</td>', 'Great clouds.TC', '2007-06-24 15:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827691, 538064, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice shot here.  Normally I say when shooting kids you should get down closer to their level with your camera.  I actually like the fact that you stayed up high for this one.  Nice tonality too.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice shot here.  Normally I say when shooting kids you should get down closer to their level with your camera.  I actually like the fact that you stayed up high for this one.  Nice tonality too.TC', '2007-06-24 15:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827694, 536391, 9906, '<td valign="top">I guess I don''t get the point of this shot.  It just looks like an assortment of items that don''t really go together well in the frame or tell any kind of story.  Sorry if I''m just slow today...<br/>TC</td>', 'I guess I don''t get the point of this shot.  It just looks like an assortment of items that don''t really go together well in the frame or tell any kind of story.  Sorry if I''m just slow today...TC', '2007-06-24 15:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827696, 537988, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  My only nit pick is that the girl is a little dark and a touch of flash on her back would help to make her pop right into the frame.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done.  My only nit pick is that the girl is a little dark and a touch of flash on her back would help to make her pop right into the frame.TC', '2007-06-24 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827697, 537735, 9906, '<td valign="top">Wow, very harsh lighting.  Bad time of day to try and get a nice shot.  See how flat it looks?  The texture is so evenly lit that you can''t see any texture.  The harsh shadow doesn''t add anything either.<br/>TC</td>', 'Wow, very harsh lighting.  Bad time of day to try and get a nice shot.  See how flat it looks?  The texture is so evenly lit that you can''t see any texture.  The harsh shadow doesn''t add anything either.TC', '2007-06-24 15:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3827698, 537297, 9906, '<td valign="top">Too bad the props were so perfect.  Takes away from the illusion that you''re flying behind it...<br/>TC</td>', 'Too bad the props were so perfect.  Takes away from the illusion that you''re flying behind it...TC', '2007-06-24 15:12:32.000000', NULL, 1);
