(3830085, 537580, 5822, '<td valign="top">Stunning capture and very interesting and unique image. I really like how the umbrella fits in nicely with the background gazebo and tent. I also like the contrast between the solid toned subjects and the nearly pointillistic background and foreground from the downpour. Congratulations on your ribbon. Well deserved.</td>', 'Stunning capture and very interesting and unique image. I really like how the umbrella fits in nicely with the background gazebo and tent. I also like the contrast between the solid toned subjects and the nearly pointillistic background and foreground from the downpour. Congratulations on your ribbon. Well deserved.', '2007-06-25 01:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3830087, 537786, 22734, '<td valign="top">Lovely mandolins. Colors and shapes weave a magic all their own. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.</td>', 'Lovely mandolins. Colors and shapes weave a magic all their own. Congratulations on your top 20 finish.', '2007-06-25 01:45:39.000000', NULL, 0),
