(3830114, 537638, 67841, '<td valign="top">Andrei, this was a great shot &amp; I can''t believe it didn''t pull 6.x!<br/> <br/>The numerous OOF comments just goes to show how lame the voters can be sometimes - it''s freakin art, people, and there''s a difference between an image having soft-focus &amp; an image being out of focus...<br/> <br/>Buy yourself a big print of this, frame it and put it in a gallery ''cause that''s where it deserves to be!</td>', 'Andrei, this was a great shot & I can''t believe it didn''t pull 6.x! The numerous OOF comments just goes to show how lame the voters can be sometimes - it''s freakin art, people, and there''s a difference between an image having soft-focus & an image being out of focus... Buy yourself a big print of this, frame it and put it in a gallery ''cause that''s where it deserves to be!', '2007-06-25 01:50:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3830122, 537580, 50641, '<td valign="top">Nice landing, sucka :) The rain in Wiesbaden looks mainly like film grain.  What a pair a pluie! Excellent processing.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-25 01:10:32.</i></td>', 'Nice landing, sucka :) The rain in Wiesbaden looks mainly like film grain.  What a pair a pluie! Excellent processing.', '2007-06-25 01:52:38.000000', '2007-06-25 02:10:32.000000', 0),
