(3831090, 537580, 50695, '<td valign="top">oh my god, this photo is stunning. Notice that you got your ribbon on the strength of all those tens. In other words, some people didn''t "get" it but a squadron of people fell in love with it. I am an aficionado of rain photos. It always amazes me how rain looks different from one photo to the next. In your photo, the rain looks like a texture, it looks like the inking or engraving technique of someone like Duhrer. For all the motion of people and water, this photo looks eternally still. I skipped this challenge, which is the only reason my admiration has been delayed thus far.</td>', 'oh my god, this photo is stunning. Notice that you got your ribbon on the strength of all those tens. In other words, some people didn''t "get" it but a squadron of people fell in love with it. I am an aficionado of rain photos. It always amazes me how rain looks different from one photo to the next. In your photo, the rain looks like a texture, it looks like the inking or engraving technique of someone like Duhrer. For all the motion of people and water, this photo looks eternally still. I skipped this challenge, which is the only reason my admiration has been delayed thus far.', '2007-06-25 09:32:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(3831109, 537827, 23484, '<td valign="top">Obviously, this reminds me of "Her favorite Dress".  I really like this Catherine. The water creates a great clutter free background.</td>', 'Obviously, this reminds me of "Her favorite Dress".  I really like this Catherine. The water creates a great clutter free background.', '2007-06-25 09:35:51.000000', NULL, 0),
