(3831344, 535422, 61961, '<td valign="top">5.58 -- not bad for a male nude on DPC, and safely in the top half of entries.  <br/>Someone wrote: "My first thought was ugghh" -- ???<br/>Jeesh, everyone''s a critic. :-)</td>', '5.58 -- not bad for a male nude on DPC, and safely in the top half of entries.  Someone wrote: "My first thought was ugghh" -- ???Jeesh, everyone''s a critic. :-)', '2007-06-25 10:25:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(3831345, 536289, 66348, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, love the composition and angle. Truly a priceless moment caught on camera. Congrats on the great finish.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, love the composition and angle. Truly a priceless moment caught on camera. Congrats on the great finish.', '2007-06-25 10:25:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3831347, 538283, 52115, '<td valign="top">Just a Candid-Shot.<br/>These were just a large group of kids lined up in knee deep water at Cedar Falls, in Hocking Hills State Park. No she was not about to do a cartwheel as commented below. The rest of the commentators guessed it, just some adolescent antics. Maybe she was showing that her shorts got muddy. <br/> <br/>There were a lot more people in the scene. Re:Karmat''s comment, I had to cut the left off closer then I wanted to, to avoid having a distracting, half a person more. For advanced editing, I would have, instead, darkened that person on the left.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all Comments and Votes.</td>', 'Just a Candid-Shot.These were just a large group of kids lined up in knee deep water at Cedar Falls, in Hocking Hills State Park. No she was not about to do a cartwheel as commented below. The rest of the commentators guessed it, just some adolescent antics. Maybe she was showing that her shorts got muddy.  There were a lot more people in the scene. Re:Karmat''s comment, I had to cut the left off closer then I wanted to, to avoid having a distracting, half a person more. For advanced editing, I would have, instead, darkened that person on the left. Thanks for all Comments and Votes.', '2007-06-25 10:26:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(3831364, 537580, 56658, '<td valign="top">simply wonderful</td>', 'simply wonderful', '2007-06-25 10:30:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3831368, 538023, 74605, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  This is one of my favorites.  The flowers are beautiful, and the old farm equipment adds a great point of interest!</td>', 'Great shot!  This is one of my favorites.  The flowers are beautiful, and the old farm equipment adds a great point of interest!', '2007-06-25 10:30:50.000000', NULL, 0),
