(3831395, 537516, 61961, '<td valign="top">Wow, from the thumbnail I thought this was a fish! LOL.  I agree with the comments about the harsh lighting, though I like the contrast between the bright orange and the dark background.</td>', 'Wow, from the thumbnail I thought this was a fish! LOL.  I agree with the comments about the harsh lighting, though I like the contrast between the bright orange and the dark background.', '2007-06-25 10:34:46.000000', NULL, 0),
