(3832611, 537071, 3214, '<td valign="top">Not my baby, it was a 3 baby client shoot.  Akhal Teke and A-T crosses.</td>', 'Not my baby, it was a 3 baby client shoot.  Akhal Teke and A-T crosses.', '2007-06-25 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3832623, 536969, 5347, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the great comments everyone.  Now to give away all my secrets...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=536992" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5347/thumb/536992.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5347/thumb/536992.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/5347/thumb/536992.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>Yes, it is a real fighter but it is mounted out of the engines at the back into the ground.  It was a fun shoot and afterwards we went into the military museum that I had never visited before.  It was fantastic and the displays were unbelievable.  So intricate and detailed it moved you emotionally and gave you the sense of being there at some of the historic wars.  I got a lot more out of this challenge than I ever expected.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for the great comments everyone.  Now to give away all my secrets...   Yes, it is a real fighter but it is mounted out of the engines at the back into the ground.  It was a fun shoot and afterwards we went into the military museum that I had never visited before.  It was fantastic and the displays were unbelievable.  So intricate and detailed it moved you emotionally and gave you the sense of being there at some of the historic wars.  I got a lot more out of this challenge than I ever expected.', '2007-06-25 16:35:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3832631, 537766, 74979, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually go for the professional model shots on this site, but this was just a stunner in every way.  I love the detail of her dress, her look, the lighting, composition;  the only thing I felt distracted was the background on the right, behind her face-a bit busy...but did set off her coloring well.   Vogue or not, this was a very different photograph for this site &amp; certainly for this challenge, &amp; very well done!  Congrats on your Top 10 finish!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-26 13:39:29.</i></td>', 'I don''t usually go for the professional model shots on this site, but this was just a stunner in every way.  I love the detail of her dress, her look, the lighting, composition;  the only thing I felt distracted was the background on the right, behind her face-a bit busy...but did set off her coloring well.   Vogue or not, this was a very different photograph for this site & certainly for this challenge, & very well done!  Congrats on your Top 10 finish!!', '2007-06-25 16:37:33.000000', '2007-06-26 14:39:29.000000', 0),
(3832636, 537790, 74979, '<td valign="top">this felt very intimate to me, and was very well executed!  Good finish-congrats!<br/> <br/></td>', 'this felt very intimate to me, and was very well executed!  Good finish-congrats! ', '2007-06-25 16:38:10.000000', NULL, 0),
