(3832963, 535127, 78396, '<td valign="top">It was outside, and not so easy to grab with a 200mm. Collared Doves are not so domesticated here. Light conditions were not optimal, so to get a sharp picture I had to try several times. I don''t like to crop or "fake" the picture with cloning too much, in fact I''ve cropped it only to a square format but it''s still printable.<br/> <br/>Thanks to all for the nice comments!</td>', 'It was outside, and not so easy to grab with a 200mm. Collared Doves are not so domesticated here. Light conditions were not optimal, so to get a sharp picture I had to try several times. I don''t like to crop or "fake" the picture with cloning too much, in fact I''ve cropped it only to a square format but it''s still printable. Thanks to all for the nice comments!', '2007-06-25 18:23:42.000000', NULL, 0),
