(3835743, 538091, 42781, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I really like ballet photos.<br/>I was looking at the whole gallery in the past 15 minutes - congratulations, there are some really nice shots. I think some images are better than this one, if it were a little bit wider (I see you know) the airy and light feeling can be better - and on some of your images it is.<br/>My favourites were: MG 027, 073, 076 and 196.<br/> <br/>The environment is really well chosen too. Nice, nice... :)</td>', 'Nice photo, I really like ballet photos.I was looking at the whole gallery in the past 15 minutes - congratulations, there are some really nice shots. I think some images are better than this one, if it were a little bit wider (I see you know) the airy and light feeling can be better - and on some of your images it is.My favourites were: MG 027, 073, 076 and 196. The environment is really well chosen too. Nice, nice... :)', '2007-06-26 10:21:52.000000', NULL, 0),
