(3836687, 537766, 74979, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by noraneko:</b></div><hr/><i> Gorgeous, Svetlana! I love the various shades of green (including your eyes - you must have changed the tint? I think I recall you have brown eyes?) You really could be a model in Vogue :-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>OK!  It''s not enough that you are boldly talented-you are also the model in this photograph?! oh, you are truly doubly blessed!!  <br/> <br/>In case you are having a bad day, it is time to celebrate your greatness, girl!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-06-26 20:10:46.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by noraneko: Gorgeous, Svetlana! I love the various shades of green (including your eyes - you must have changed the tint? I think I recall you have brown eyes?) You really could be a model in Vogue :-)   OK!  It''s not enough that you are boldly talented-you are also the model in this photograph?! oh, you are truly doubly blessed!!   In case you are having a bad day, it is time to celebrate your greatness, girl!', '2007-06-26 14:48:55.000000', '2007-06-26 21:10:46.000000', 0),
