Nice shot... Edit - Okay, apparently I DON''T have tons of photos like yours. I guess since JetPhotos didn''t like them I must have tossed them. I did find this one but it''s not as good lighting nor quite the same angle. Anyway... ', '2007-06-30 01:16:46.000000', '2007-06-30 03:37:43.000000', 0),
