(3852784, 537626, 4226, '<td valign="top">** Critique club **<br/> <br/>Dramatic lighting. It bring my attention to the subject. I like the overall warm feeling to the image. The lines look crooked. Looking at it carefully, I can see the wall edge is aligned, but other lines somehow don''t which made it look crooked. <br/> <br/>Personally, I would crop some of the bottom in this frame which doesn''t add much to the image. that should also move the  center divide line further down and help the composition. <br/> <br/>I like the lighting and you did a great job with this. <br/> <br/>if you have any questions, feel free to contact me via pm<br/> <br/>thanks,<br/>Gaurawa</td>', '** Critique club ** Dramatic lighting. It bring my attention to the subject. I like the overall warm feeling to the image. The lines look crooked. Looking at it carefully, I can see the wall edge is aligned, but other lines somehow don''t which made it look crooked.  Personally, I would crop some of the bottom in this frame which doesn''t add much to the image. that should also move the  center divide line further down and help the composition.  I like the lighting and you did a great job with this.  if you have any questions, feel free to contact me via pm thanks,Gaurawa', '2007-07-01 04:40:51.000000', NULL, 0),
