(4099536, 537500, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, Sher, this is beautiful!  That flower looks like she''s reaching for the sunshine, really wanting some sunshine.  It took me a moment to get used to the idea of it being cut off on the left there, sort of like my eyes are just straining to see what''s there, but all they see is the black bar and the background - but it actually works I think.  It makes for a sense of urgency to the getting the sunshine idea.  Although maybe I''m just reading way too much into this.  It is beautiful!</td>', 'Wow, Sher, this is beautiful!  That flower looks like she''s reaching for the sunshine, really wanting some sunshine.  It took me a moment to get used to the idea of it being cut off on the left there, sort of like my eyes are just straining to see what''s there, but all they see is the black bar and the background - but it actually works I think.  It makes for a sense of urgency to the getting the sunshine idea.  Although maybe I''m just reading way too much into this.  It is beautiful!', '2007-09-18 18:45:25.000000', NULL, 0),
