(4512670, 537626, 47852, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of this image is the tiny wag of the tip of her tail.  It gives just a hint of passing time and the patient watching that cats are so good at.  Beautifully processed, and I think I like the empty space at the bottom.  I don''t know why, but I do.</td>', 'My favorite part of this image is the tiny wag of the tip of her tail.  It gives just a hint of passing time and the patient watching that cats are so good at.  Beautifully processed, and I think I like the empty space at the bottom.  I don''t know why, but I do.', '2008-02-24 19:40:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4516214, 537580, 8759, '<td valign="top">Wow. Beautiful photo. I skipped it but goes to my favorites. <br/> <br/>Congrats.</td>', 'Wow. Beautiful photo. I skipped it but goes to my favorites.  Congrats.', '2008-02-25 18:54:02.000000', NULL, 0),
