(4544399, 537782, 60862, '<td valign="top">Cool painting. :)  Not sure about the desat, like other commenters, but hey, do you like it?  If so, ''nuff said.</td>', 'Cool painting. :)  Not sure about the desat, like other commenters, but hey, do you like it?  If so, ''nuff said.', '2008-03-06 23:07:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(4554150, 537580, 90394, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful! Perfect contrasts/gradients, and a superb capture of the weather. That both subjects are wearing the same color/style coats was either luck, or you used models, but there''s nothing here to suggest anything but a wonderful, candid shot that is expertly timed and composed. Easily a 9 in my book.</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful! Perfect contrasts/gradients, and a superb capture of the weather. That both subjects are wearing the same color/style coats was either luck, or you used models, but there''s nothing here to suggest anything but a wonderful, candid shot that is expertly timed and composed. Easily a 9 in my book.', '2008-03-11 02:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4568275, 538091, 90947, '<td valign="top">Love it.  I am watching <u>Cutting Edge</u> and the model is giving you the feeling of ice... sans Ice.  Grace personafied. Pity about the left foot.</td>', 'Love it.  I am watching Cutting Edge and the model is giving you the feeling of ice... sans Ice.  Grace personafied. Pity about the left foot.', '2008-03-16 22:32:43.000000', NULL, 0),
