(4669815, 536593, 73980, '<td valign="top">Not only is this an awesome shot, just purely beautiful, but I read every single word of your trials and tribulations of taking this.  You did an amazing job and dare i say deserve probably even better than a red?   At age 19, you are already a genius with a camera, very very talented!!  You paid so much attention to getting this shot and getting it right, you''ve impressed me for sure!</td>', 'Not only is this an awesome shot, just purely beautiful, but I read every single word of your trials and tribulations of taking this.  You did an amazing job and dare i say deserve probably even better than a red?   At age 19, you are already a genius with a camera, very very talented!!  You paid so much attention to getting this shot and getting it right, you''ve impressed me for sure!', '2008-05-01 02:11:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4830556, 536593, 85118, '<td valign="top">What a FANTASTIC shot and so much effort to get it. I love the feeling this image gives, the peace, the sun, the water and the composition. You deserve that ribbon.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-17 05:27:33.</i></td>', 'What a FANTASTIC shot and so much effort to get it. I love the feeling this image gives, the peace, the sun, the water and the composition. You deserve that ribbon.', '2008-07-17 06:27:12.000000', '2008-07-17 06:27:33.000000', 0),
