(5492102, 536894, 31637, '<td valign="top">I remember this photo very well:) Beautiful architecture everywhere. Reminds me of my city in someways, rustic but still refined, less industrial and more hand-made I guess I could say. I loved it since it was so serene yet busy too. No automobile traffic in an urban setting always makes for great scenes.</td>', 'I remember this photo very well:) Beautiful architecture everywhere. Reminds me of my city in someways, rustic but still refined, less industrial and more hand-made I guess I could say. I loved it since it was so serene yet busy too. No automobile traffic in an urban setting always makes for great scenes.', '2009-05-19 03:55:40.000000', NULL, 0),
